      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0070",
      "lineIndex": 70,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੁਲ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasatul pranaame samasatul pranaase ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Most Venerated and Destroyer of all Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਭਨਾ ਦੁਆਰਾ ਨਮਸਕਾਰੇ ਜਾਣ ਵਾਲੇ (ਉਸ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਨੂੰ) ਮੇਰਾ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮ ਹੈ, ਜੋ ਸਭ ਦਾ ਸੰਘਾਰਕ ਹੈ, ਨਾਸ਼ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतुल प्रनामे समसतुल प्रणासे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75007",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0071",
      "lineIndex": 71,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਗੰਜੁਲ ਅਨਾਮੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aga(n)jul anaame samasatul nivaase ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Indestructible, Nameless and All-Pervading Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਨਾਮ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਸਭ ਵਿਚ ਵਸਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अगंजुल अनामे समसतुल निवासे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75008",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0072",
      "lineIndex": 72,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਕਾਮੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਸਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirakaama(n) bibhoote samasatul saroope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Desireless, Glorious and All-Pervading Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕਾਮਨਾਵਾ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ ਸੰਪੱਤੀ ਵਾਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ (ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਨੂੰ ਮੇਰਾ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮ ਹੈ)।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृकामं बिभूते समसतुल सरूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75009",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0073",
      "lineIndex": 73,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕੁਕਰਮੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ ਸੁਧਰਮੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ॥੧੯੭॥",
      "transliteration": "kukarama(n) pranaasee sudharama(n) bibhoote ||197||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Destroyer of Evil and Illuminator of Supreme Piety Lord! 197.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਹ ਕੁਕਰਮਾ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੁਭ ਧਰਮ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਸਜਿਤ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ ॥੧੯੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कुकरमं प्रणासी सुधरमं बिभूते ॥१९७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75010",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0074",
      "lineIndex": 74,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦਾ ਸੱਚਿਦਾਨੰਦ ਸੱਤ੍ਰੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaa sa'chidhaana(n)dh sa'tra(n) pranaasee ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Perpetual Embodiment of Truth, Consciousness and Bliss and Destroyer of enemies Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ! ਤੂੰ) ਸਦਾ ਚੇਤਨ ਅਤੇ ਆਨੰਦ-ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ ਅਤੇ ਵੈਰੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदा सच्चिदानंद सत्त्रं प्रणासी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75011",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0075",
      "lineIndex": 75,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਰੀਮੁਲ ਕੁਨਿੰਦਾ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kareemul kuni(n)dhaa samasatul nivaasee ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Gracious Creator and All-Pervading Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤੂੰ) ਮਿਹਰ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ, ਕਰਨਹਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸਭ ਵਿਚ ਨਿਵਾਸ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "करीमुल कुनिंदा समसतुल निवासी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75012",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0076",
      "lineIndex": 76,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਜਾਇਬ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ਗਜਾਇਬ ਗਨੀਮੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ajaib bibhoote gajaib ganeeme ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Wonderful, Glorious and Calamity for enemies Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤੂੰ) ਅਦਭੁਤ ਸੰਪੱਤੀ ਵਾਲਾ, ਦੁਸ਼ਮਣਾ ਉਤੇ ਕਹਿਰ ਢਾਉਣ ਵਾਲਾ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अजाइब बिभूते गजाइब गनीमे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75013",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0077",
      "lineIndex": 77,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹਰੀਅੰ ਕਰੀਅੰ ਕਰੀਮਲੁ ਰਹੀਮੇ ॥੧੯੮॥",
      "transliteration": "hareea(n) kareea(n) kareemal raheeme ||198||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Destroyer, Creator, Gracious and Merciful Lord! 198.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਨਾਸ਼ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ, ਸਿਰਜਨ ਵਾਲਾ, ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਅਤੇ ਦਇਆ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੯੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हरीअं करीअं करीमलु रहीमे ॥१९८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75014",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0078",
      "lineIndex": 78,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚੱਤ੍ਰ ਚੱਕ੍ਰ ਵਰਤੀ ਚੱਤ੍ਰ ਚੱਕ੍ਰ ਭੁਗਤੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "cha'tr cha'kr varatee cha'tr cha'kr bhugate ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Pervader and Enjoyer in all the four directions Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚੌਹਾ ਚੱਕਾ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ, ਚੌਹਾ ਚੱਕਾ ਨੂੰ ਭੋਗਣ ਵਾਲਾ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चत्त्र चक्क्र वरती चत्त्र चक्क्र भुगते ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75015",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0079",
      "lineIndex": 79,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁਯੰਭਵ ਸੁਭੰ ਸਰਬਦਾ ਸਰਬ ਜੁਗਤੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "suya(n)bhav subha(n) sarabadhaa sarab jugate ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Self-Existent, Most Beautiful and United with all Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਸ਼ੋਭਾਇਮਾਨ ਹੋਣ ਵਾਲਾ, ਸਦਾ ਹੀ ਸਭ ਨਾਲ ਸੰਯੁਕਤ ਰਹਿਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुयंभव सुभं सरबदा सरब जुगते ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75016",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0080",
      "lineIndex": 80,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੁਕਾਲੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ ਦਿਆਲੰ ਸਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhukaala(n) pranaasee dhiaala(n) saroope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Destroyer of hard times and Embodiment of Mercy Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬੁਰੇ ਸਮੇਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਅਤੇ ਦਿਆਲੂ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दुकालं प्रणासी दिआलं सरूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75017",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0010_line_0081",
      "lineIndex": 81,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦਾ ਅੰਗ ਸੰਗੇ ਅਭੰਗੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ॥੧੯੯॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaa a(n)g sa(n)ge abha(n)ga(n) bibhoote ||199||",
      "translation": "Salutation to thee O Ever present with all, Indestructible and Glorious Lord! 199.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤੂੰ) ਸਦਾ ਅੰਗ-ਸੰਗ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈਂ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਹੋਣ ਵਾਲੀ ਸੰਪੱਤੀ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਦਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੯੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 10,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदा अंग संगे अभंगं बिभूते ॥१९९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "75018",
      "sourceShabadId": "7423",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    }
  ]
}
